    "rule": {
      "choice": "the eligible NVIDIA model (identifier beginning nvidia/) with the lowest p95 draft time is chosen when that p95 is at most speed_bound_ms; otherwise the eligible model with the lowest p95 draft time. Ties go to more matched, then to the lower total cost.",
      "draft_time": "one description's draft time is the sum of its drafter attempts' latencies, as the client measured each",
      "eligible": "a candidate is eligible when at least 10 of the 12 descriptions were valid on the first try and at least 10 of the 12 matched",
      "fallback": "the fallback is the next eligible model in the same order (NVIDIA first when within speed_bound_ms, then by p95), or none when no other model is eligible",
